                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A fun but tough platformer with a fantastic soundtrack. The jumping is floaty, but I think it works well for the game. However, the cave levels are irritating auto-runners where you can only crouch and jump. Crouching doesn't slow you down so you can crouch the whole way and focus on jumping, but jump at the wrong nanosecond and you're back to the start of the level.  Everything outside of the cave levels are great though if you like challenging \nplatformers.",
